  "series": null,
  "content_html": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/94943d7512ce3b05ab.png\"><img alt=\"מנהל חשבונות אוחז את ראשו בין כפות ידיו כשעל השולחן נערמים מסמכי החשבונות\" border=\"0\" height=\"213\" src=\"/assets/images/content/94943d7512ce3b05ab.png\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">מספר חזק</span></h2><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><blockquote>וּסְפַרְתֶּם לָכֶם מִמָּחֳרַת הַשַּׁבָּת</blockquote></span></div><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כֻּלָּם אוֹהֲבִים לִסְפֹּר!</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">נְקֻדָּה.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">קָדִימָה אוֹ אָחוֹר,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עֻבְדָּה.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַחַיִּים - מִתְקַדְּמִים,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַבִּירוֹקְרַטְיָה - חוֹגֶגֶת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַמִּסְפָּרִים - מִתְאָרְכִים,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כִּמְעַט בְּלִי תּוֹחֶלֶת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אִם פַּעַם הָיוּ רַק,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מִסְפָּרִים סְפוּרִים.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">סַךְ קַעֲרוֹת מָרָק,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְשִׁבְעָה נְקִיִּים.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הֲרֵי שֶׁהַיּוֹם,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">סוֹפְרִים כָּל מָה שֶׁזָּז.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מְמַהֲרִים לִרְשֹׁם,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מוֹנִי חַשְׁמַל וְגַז.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מִסְפְּרֵי אַסְמַכְתָּא,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אִינְסְטָלַצְיָה בִּנְקֻדּוֹת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בְּחַבְרוּתָא/בְּצַוְתָּא,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מַשְׁוִים טָסִיּוֹת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">חַיָּלִים סוֹפְרִים לְאָחוֹר,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בַּנְקָאִים - מַטְבְּעוֹת וּשְׁטָרוֹת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַמְּלַוִּים בַּשּׁוּק הָאָפֹר,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֶת אֲחוּזֵי הָרִבִּיּוֹת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">פַּחְמֵימוֹת, צְעָדִים וְקָלוֹרְיוֹת,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מִסְפְּרֵי גּוּשׁ וְחֶלְקָהּ.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מִסְפָּרִים בְּקוֹמוֹת כְּשֵׁרוֹת,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וּבְעִקָּר מִסְפְּרֵי הַזְמָנָה.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לִפְנֵי הַשֵּׁנָה,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">סוֹפְרִים כְּבָשִׂים.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עוֹבְדֵי מְדִינָה,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מוֹנִים אַבְרֵכִים.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כָּל אִינְטֵלֶקְטוּאָל רַנְדּוֹמָלִי,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מְסַפֵּר עַל מִסְפַּר פִּיבּוֹנָאצִ'י.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כָּל קְרִימִינָל קַרְדִּינָלִי,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מְחַשֵּׁב שְׁלִישׁ פוֹנְקְצִיּוֹנָלִי.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אַךְ רַק חִשּׁוּב אֶחָד,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">נוֹתַר עֲדַיִן עָלוּם.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְהַמֹּחַ הֲכִי חַד,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">עוֹמֵד מוּלוֹ עָגוּם.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֵיךְ לְכָל הָרוּחוֹת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וּבְאֵלּוּ אֶמְצָעִים.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מְחַשְּׁבִים לְלָקוֹחוֹת,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">30 יְמֵי עֲסָקִים...</span></p>"
}
